; Stage 1 of draft-ndn-maru-typed-tree-matching-00: intent as requirements and a goal.
; Evidence is events in evidence.john, appended by notes/plan/record from real check runs.
; A requirement is green if it passed and hasn't failed since (after McCarthy's Elephant).
start-world plan.
create Req needs also done.
create Team.
make Req None None None yes.
make Req Selectors None None no.
make Req Source Selectors None no.
make Req Lists Source None no.
make Req Args Lists None no.
make Req Interleave Source None no.
make Req Apply Args Interleave no.
make Req Memos Lists None no.
make Req Foreign Memos None no.
make Req Literals Source None no.
make Req Calc Memos Args no.
make Req Speed Source None no.
make Req Suite Calc Foreign no.
make Team T.
action Req passed.
action Req failed.
qualify Req green if
  for some time K up to time do ((at time K it did passed) and
                                 not for some time U after K up to time do (at time U it did failed)).
action Team finish Req consequence Req done = yes.
rule Team finish is Req done = no.
rule Team finish is Req needs done = yes.
rule Team finish is Req also done = yes.
goal Team ship try Suite done = yes and Speed done = yes and Literals done = yes.
